  "0. NFC-normalize the text",
  "1. strip every \\p{Cf} character (soft hyphen, U+200B-U+200F, U+202A-U+202E, U+2060-U+2064, U+FEFF, ...)",
  "2. every remaining character except U+0020 U+0009 U+000A U+000D must be a code point in drawable-codepoints.json (U+2800 U+3164 U+115F U+1160 U+FFA0 and U+FE0F are not Cf: they stay and fail here)",
  "3. at least one run of 2+ [A-Za-z0-9] must remain"
 ]
